# =========================================================================
# BrandGuard AI — Supabase Cloud Database Configuration
# =========================================================================
# 1. Sign up for a free Supabase project at https://supabase.com
# 2. In your Supabase Dashboard, navigate to: Project Settings -> API
# 3. Copy your "Project URL" and public "anon" key into the placeholders below:

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-api-key-here

# 4. In Supabase Dashboard -> SQL Editor, run the script in: supabase/schema.sql
#
# NOTE: BrandGuard AI automatically falls back to offline LocalStorage mode
# when these variables are not configured. No data is lost and existing workflows
# continue functioning immediately.
